  "description": "Surround recording of a hiking track in the Biokovo Mountain National Park in Croatia.\r\nThis recording was done from a higer position than the other one, it is somewhat mor wide-angle and features more wind and less cricketts.\r\nGood, clean mediterranian summer-atmo, ideal for motion-picture or broadcast work.\r\nIt is noon, very hot and sunny and millions of crickets are chirping. In the distance, some goat-bells can be heard, otherwise the place is deserted.\r\nIn the middle of the recording, a bumble-bee flies by the mics.\r\nRecorded with a Zoom H2.\r\nThis file contains the rear channels, recorded with 120° dispersion.\r\n",
